  but like we've seen time and time again  there will likely be some grey areas in  this definition  where the military equipment  manufacturers are willing to push the  line  [Music]  plus let's face it it wouldn't be the  first time that a secret shadowy  organization  deemed to be above the law has gone out  of their way to produce technology and  weaponry that would otherwise be frowned  upon  or illegal in other sectors  i've been thinking about discussing this  for a year or two now but i wasn't sure  if this was what people wanted to watch  truth be told  i have a bunch of scripts that are put  together over the years but never  recorded and made them into videos  because although i was intrigued enough  to research and write about them  i wasn't sure if anyone else was  obviously there are certain things i  didn't address  like the fact that some of this tech  seems to have an unlimited stockpile of  ammo for example  but some things will really just come  down to game mechanics and quality of  life for the player  if you'd like to see more of these types  of videos where i speculate and attempt  to tighten the gap between the game  universe  and real life let me know in the  comments otherwise thank you very much  for watching and i'll catch in the next  one  [Music]  cheers  [Music]  uh

